    "title": "P.E.O hosts successful Tour of Tables to raise funds for scholarships - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ton Winter ,\n22 hours ago WHEATLAND – The much anticipated P.E.O. Tour of Tables occurred Sunday, Oct. 26 at the Platte County Agriplex. Attended by all ages, the event raises funds for scholarships for women to further their education. P.E.O. is a philanthropic organization made up of women supporting women. There are two chapters... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
